      "reason": "The harness's fixed environment does not enable cheat-on-close broker behavior, so a same-bar close-price fill cannot be produced by a standard order; this is the closest literal reading available."
    },
    {
      "topic": "reference frame for decline check",
      "choice": "Close[0], SMA(Close,20)[0], and Close[-5] in the decline definition are evaluated on the same current bar that serves as the tweezer confirmation candle (bar 0), with bars -2/-1 as the preceding tweezer candles.",
      "reason": "The spec's numbering (bars -2, -1, 0) is consistent only if all three sub-conditions (decline, tweezer setup, confirmation) reference the same current bar as bar 0; this is the natural literal reading."
    },
